// Zero-storage portion of the classic ESP32 if_hwctrl surface. These entries
// are internal typed Abla adapters. Transparent forwards call their recovered
// Abla implementations directly; wrappers which narrow arguments, skip null
// callbacks, or normalize results spell those semantics out in ordinary Abla.
// Behavior-bearing policy lives in interface_control_esp32.ab.

